df.groupby('store', as_index=False).agg(
    total_revenue=('revenue', 'sum'),
    total_staff=('staff', 'sum')
).assign(
    revenue_per_staff=lambda x: x['total_revenue'] / x['total_staff'].replace(0, pd.NA)
).sort_values(
    'revenue_per_staff', ascending=False
).head(1)
```

